WEBVTT

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:01.634
govori sporo vlastitim tihim glasom

00:12:01.634 --> 00:12:03.938
i svakodnevno radi

00:12:03.938 --> 00:12:07.658
na pokretanju svog paraliziranog tijela.

00:12:09.148 --> 00:12:11.499
Ali taj posao nikad neće biti gotov.

00:12:11.499 --> 00:12:16.212
Kao što sam kaže: 
"Živim u svijetu u ruševinama

00:12:16.212 --> 00:12:18.273
i čeka me nebeski posao."

00:12:19.243 --> 00:12:20.703
Hvala vam.

00:12:20.703 --> 00:12:25.120
(Pljesak)